# 3. TECHNOLOGY STACK

Use:

| Layer            | Technology      |
| ---------------- | --------------- |
| Game Engine      | Phaser 3        |
| Language         | TypeScript      |
| UI               | React           |
| Build            | Vite            |
| Styling          | TailwindCSS     |
| State Management | Zustand         |
| Persistence      | IndexedDB       |
| PWA              | vite-plugin-pwa |
| Hosting          | Vercel          |

Use a frontend-only architecture.

No backend, database server, or authentication is required for the MVP.

### Architecture

Phaser handles:

- Game loop.
- Rendering.
- Movement.
- Enemy AI.
- Combat.
- Projectiles.
- Physics and collisions.
- Camera.
- Particle effects.
- World animations.

React handles:

- Main menu.
- Gameplay HUD.
- Pause menu.
- Level-up modal.
- Game-over screen.
- Upgrade shop.
- Settings.

Use a typed event bridge between Phaser and React.

Do not store individual enemy positions in React or Zustand.

