# 7. CORE GAMEPLAY

The game follows this loop:

1. Start a survival run.
2. Enemies spawn outside the camera.
3. Enemies move toward the player.
4. Weapons automatically attack.
5. Defeated enemies drop XP.
6. Player collects XP.
7. Player levels up.
8. Gameplay pauses.
9. Three random upgrades appear.
10. Player selects one upgrade.
11. Gameplay resumes.
12. Enemy difficulty increases.
13. Final boss appears.
14. Player wins or loses.
15. Player receives gold.
16. Gold is spent on permanent upgrades.
17. Player starts another run.

### Match duration

Target: approximately 5 minutes.

The first 30 seconds should be easy to understand and satisfying.

Difficulty should increase progressively.

